etItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3925750,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3925750","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:16:18Z","value":8,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5217230","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3925750-1846651706692014","game_id":"steam-3925750","kind":"announcement","title":"Generic Fighter Maybe is in next fest!","summary":"Next Fest just got started, and Generic Fighter Maybe is a part of it! Watch our pre-recorded broadcast (it'll stream all week long!) and play the Demo! https://steamcommunity.com/broadcast/watch/76561199084214857","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692014","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3925750-1846018067941165","game_id":"steam-3925750","kind":"announcement","title":"The Online Playtest has begun!","summary":"The online playtest has just started! We decided at the last second to just make it completely open. Just hit Play Now in the game's store page, and you're in! Like we mentioned in the previous announcement, this is the first time we're testing this game's netcode in a public environment, so there's bound to be issues. Anything you find, we want to hear about it. The sooner you let us know, the sooner we can fix it. We'll be releasing patches through the week to keep improving the game and make ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:39:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941165","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3925750-1846018067937261","game_id":"steam-3925750","kind":"announcement","title":"First Online Playtest!","summary":"Only two days left for the playtest! I you haven't already, sign up to get a chance to try the game's online mode for the first time ever! It'll run from October 12 to October 18, ending just as Next Fest begins! This test uses our own custom rollback system, which works with Steam's lobby system. This is the first time we're trying it out publicly, so things are probably not gonna be 100% flawless. But we've given it a ton of tests internally, and we think it's already in a good enough state fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T20:34:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937261","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3925750-1844751498230923","game_id":"steam-3925750","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Survival Mode!","summary":"Survival Mode is now available in the Demo! You may have already played a version of this mode if you played the game back in the Offline Playtest. But we're doing something a little different this time around. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45765387/4a1e52df4ae053c2055332572f360983fe4d5c5f.png Inbetween matches, you'll visit the Survival lobby. In here you'll be able to select your next opponent, giving you a little bit of control over your next matchup. Most importantly though, after the second match, you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T08:59:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230923","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3925750-1839041357034474","game_id":"steam-3925750","kind":"update","title":"Development Update: Online Lobbies","summary":"Hey there! This is Khao, the lead dev for GFM. Things have been quiet for a bit, but I've been making a ton of progress behind the scenes, and I wanted to show-off some of the progress so you know where we're at right now. After the playtest, about 90% of the work has been dedicated to online play. If you've been following the game on discord, you'll know that we managed to get Rollback working (that was kind of a massive relief, netcode is scary!) and after that, we've been making a ton of prog","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T22:38:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357034474","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3925750-1831432155571503","game_id":"steam-3925750","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest begins!","summary":"The first Generic Fighter Maybe playtest begins today! The game will be available to play for an entire week, until May 7th! If you haven't requested access, it's not too late, we're pretty much letting everyone in so far, so just go for it!We have a Discord server too! https://discord.gg/28pHTmUceXAlso, once again I want to remind everyone that this playtest only includes local play. You can still use Remote Play Together to fight a friend if you want, but ideally you'll want to play with peopl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-01T14:23:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155571503","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3925750-1830797770236817","game_id":"steam-3925750","kind":"announcement","title":"Join the first official playtest on May 1st!","summary":"You'll finally get a chance to test the game on May 1st!This is a chance to try out all the new characters we've been working on. We've got 4 characters ready to go! We've got 3 modes for you to try out: Versus, Training, and Survival. This time, every mode is only available for local play, as our Online systems are still being worked on. But later this year, we'll hold another Playtest just to try out the online!If you really want to play online right now, we'll be enabling Remote Play Together","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-24T16:58:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770236817","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3925750-1819386365116506","game_id":"steam-3925750","kind":"announcement","title":"Fuluglugli VS Glorbolgo - Full match","summary":"Happy new year! This is gonna be a great year for Generic Fighter Maybe, I've already made some great progress with development, and to share a little bit with you, I prepared a gameplay video showing a full match with 2 of the new characters: Fuluglugli, the generic Zoner, and Glorbolgo, the generic Rushdown!Can't wait to let everyone try these characters for themselves! In the meantime, I hope you enjoy the video!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-31T20:30:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365116506","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3925750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:44Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3925750":"2026-10-26T01:00:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3925750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5217230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:00:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3925750","app_id":3925750,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:24Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b25a0572daff55ee9657156c37988610c8ba4c2cdd9103a4f879ffc8bf9e355c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A classic arcade-style 2D Fighting Game, wrapped up in a goofy, full-of-energy, stylized presentation that mixes great animation and zany battle moves with simplistic doodles!","publishers":[{"name":"Astrobard Games","creator_clan_account_id":45723054}],"developers":[{"name":"Astrobard Games","creator_clan_account_id":45723054}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Announcement Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1756850099","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"3925750/247325988/18316a79671a722a66bb322f526e28da1727912a/1756759934/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"3925750/247325988/18316a79671a722a66bb322f526e28da1727912a/1756759934/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"3925750/247325988/18316a79671a722a66bb322f526e28da1727912a/1756759934/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"3925750/247325988/18316a79671a722a66bb322f526e28da1727912a/1756759934/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"3925750/247325988/18316a79671a722a66bb322f526e28da1727912a/1756759934/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding"